    <div class="intro-content the-economy">
        <p class="icon-type-label icon-type-news-release">News Release</p>

        <h1 itemprop="name">Philadelphia Fed&rsquo;s Harker: We May Be at Point to Hold Interest Rates Steady and Let Monetary Policy Work</h1>


        <p class="article-date-published" itemprop="datePublished">08 Aug ’23</p>

        <p class="intro-excerpt" itemprop="description">President Patrick T. Harker shared his insights about the region’s economic health at the Philadelphia Business Journal’s State of the Economy forum.</p>

        <div class="article-intro-footer">

            <div>


            </div>



        </div>


    </div>

</div>

